+ * not kept: the jar is always empty. KZ3 1.14 (0x84b5c) first asks Export for the size with a null buffer, sizes its
+ * buffer to the answer, exports, and later re-imports the bytes it kept; an empty jar (size 0, CELL_OK) and an
